.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH tag 1  "tag " 
.SH NAME
tag \- Add or remove tags: fg tag <name> add|remove <tag>…
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtag\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR> <\fIACTION\fR> [\fITAGS\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Add or remove tags: fg tag <name> add|remove <tag>…
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>
Snippet name
.TP
<\fIACTION\fR>
`add` or `remove`
.TP
[\fITAGS\fR]
Tags to add or remove
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  fg tag ubuntu\-setup add ubuntu base
